{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18743","headline":"华清词 · 刘禹锡","name":"华清词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日出骊山东，裴回照温泉。\n楼台影玲珑，稍稍开白烟。\n言昔太上皇，常居此祈年。\n风中闻清乐，往往来列仙。\n翠华入五云，紫气归上玄。\n哀哀生人泪，泣尽弓劒前。\n圣道本自我，凡情徒顒然。\n小臣感玄化，一望青冥天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18743.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18743","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}